  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Driving Down Dengue in the Lao PDR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the program is to contribute to a reduction of dengue transmission in Lao PDR, by using the Australian-developed Wolbachia method.  This program is implemented by Save the Children Laos in partnership with the Lao Ministry of Health and World Mosquito Program in 9 districts of Vientiane Capital, and the capital towns of Luang Prabang, Oudomxay, Savannakhet and Champasak provinces.</narrative>
  </description>
